{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05、S09、S13等段的感受词偏密，部分意象切换过快，容易让人顾着接收感受而忽略人物主线。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的关键词加亮和短句分层，让我能迅速抓住每段人物心理的变化；感受词随音乐逐步出现，也让我有机会边听边补充细节，而不是一次读完一堆文字。反复出现的水面、摇荡、小船等意象还形成了贯穿始终的感官线索，尤其音乐细节与人物情绪的对应比Y丰富。Y的因果解释更完整顺畅，但左侧长句在听音乐时不容易快速扫完，部分细腻的音乐变化也被概括掉了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8edd579b-f9f5-4823-b589-49abced1ce05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193130041422Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:33:11.803116+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7820337661a52d8c1a6a47248f2b24666c2a365d1d36057feda783a32021aa59", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee